     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Can you try this instead?<div><br></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\">sudo su - -c &quot;R -e \\&quot;<span style=\"font-size:small\">options(download.file.method = &#39;libcurl&#39;);</span><span style=\"font-size:12.8px\">install.packages(&#39;shiny&#39;, repos=&#39;</span><a href=\"https://cran.rstudio.com/&#39;\" style=\"font-size:12.8px\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://cran.rstudio.com/&#39;&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792394559148000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3jaMrTykUCipz141AYB97S\">https://cran.rstudio.com/&#39;</a><span style=\"font-size:12.8px\">)\\&quot;&quot;</span></div></div><div><br></div></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div>"
